; The Blue Danube (An der schoenen blauen Donau) - Walzer 1 excerpt
; Simplified from page 2 of the piano score for PC-8001mkII 3ch BEEP.
;
; This is not a full piano transcription. Dense chords, inner voices, and
; ornaments are reduced to:
;   @1 main melody
;   @2 bass on beat 1
;   @3 light waltz accompaniment on beats 2-3
;
; Convert with:
;   python3 tools/mml2sound.py examples/PC80mk2_BlueDanube_Walzer1.mml

